                       <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
                       <span>已过审就绪</span>
                     </span>`
                  : `<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30">
                       <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse"></span>
